################################################################################
# File:    @USB_VM@:/etc/buskill/buskill.rules -> /etc/udev/rules.d/buskill.rules
# Purpose: Add buskill rules. For more info, see: https://buskill.in/qubes-os/
#          This is a placeholder. The BusKill trigger rule is written in
#          runtime with the buskill-update-udev-rules script. The trigger value
#          is stored in qubesdb as the /vm-config/buskill-trigger key. Don't
#          edit this file, because the changes will be overwritten, e.g. if
#          your USB qube is a disposable. To change the trigger, use the
#          buskill-set-trigger-to script (either in dom0 or in your other
#          interface qube)
################################################################################
